SUMMARY:1. Introduction and Logistics - Grad Student Spotlights
DESCRIPTION:Grad Student Spotlights (10-minute talks by 4 current graduate 
 students)\n\nArchit Rathore: Exploring the Shape of Activations - A BERT c
 ase studyBenwei Shi: At-the-time and Back-in-time Persistent Sketches\nJoe
  Vinu: What all it takes for Performant Deep Nets to be Reliable and Fair?
 \nBrian Lavallee: Rounding Out Structural Rounding\nVivek Gupta: Inference
  on Tables as Semi-Structured Data\n\nhttps://datascience.utah.edu/talks/2
 021-01-22-grad-student-spotlights/
